    <title>Run mini-swe-agent on ProgramBench!</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The main feature is compatibility with &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/facebookresearch/ProgramBench/&quot;&gt;ProgramBench&lt;/a&gt;, a new and ultra-challenging software benchmark.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; href=&quot;https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13602468/596160405-ee861c54-1696-4096-b458-70c31b24f557.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..tRms2zRgGBK9BO9F1YwWMntroAtbJmelYNwxR-Q2azk&quot;&gt;&lt;img width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;438&quot; alt=&quot;programbench mini announcement&quot; src=&quot;https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/13602468/596160405-ee861c54-1696-4096-b458-70c31b24f557.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..tRms2zRgGBK9BO9F1YwWMntroAtbJmelYNwxR-Q2azk&quot; content-type-secured-asset=&quot;image/png&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 438px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Fixes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix: add exist_ok=True to mkdir in BubblewrapEnvironment by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/hobostay/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/hobostay&quot;&gt;@hobostay&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4177761129&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent/issues/802&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent/pull/802/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent/pull/802&quot;&gt;#802&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix/cost limit zero by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/klieret/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/klieret&quot;&gt;@klieret&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4400158557&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent/issues/825&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent/pull/825/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent/pull/825&quot;&gt;#825&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix: add wall-clock time limit to properly kill agents by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/klieret/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/klieret&quot;&gt;@klieret&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;4490428666&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent/issues/832&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent/pull/832/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SWE-agent/mini-swe-agent/pull/832&quot;&gt;#832&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
